<%- include('header') %><section class="workspace"><a class="back" href="/dashboard">← My prompts</a><div class="heading-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">MONETIZATION</p><h1>Earnings and eligibility</h1></div><span class="pill <%= monetization.status === 'monetized' ? 'published' : '' %>"><%= monetization.status === 'eligible_for_review' ? 'REVIEW READY' : monetization.status === 'monetized' ? 'MONETIZED' : monetization.status === 'paused' ? 'PAUSED' : 'NOT MONETIZED' %></span></div><section class="monetization-card card"><div><h2>Your current position</h2><p class="muted"><strong><%= monetization.publishedPrompts %></strong> published prompts · <strong><%= monetization.measuredVisitors.toLocaleString() %></strong> measured public visitors in the last 30 days.</p></div><div class="progress-grid"><div><span>Eligibility requirement</span><strong>10 prompts</strong></div><div><span>Eligibility requirement</span><strong>5,000 visitors / 30d</strong></div></div><p class="muted full"><strong>Measured visitors are not payable ad impressions.</strong> They are a progress signal only. Review checks traffic quality, prohibited content and policy compliance before ads are enabled.</p></section><p class="lead compact">Use this calculator to understand the model. It does not create an earnings balance or a payout promise.</p><div class="calculator-grid"><form class="card stack" id="earnings-form"><h2>Your assumptions</h2><label>Monthly page views<input name="pageViews" type="number" value="<%= Math.max(monetization.measuredVisitors, 10000) %>" min="0" max="1000000000" step="1" required></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Ad slots per page<input name="slots" type="number" value="1" min="0" max="4" step="1" required></label><label>Ad fill rate (%)<input name="fillRate" type="number" value="70" min="0" max="100" step="1" required></label></div><label>Ad revenue per 1,000 filled impressions (USD)<input name="ecpm" type="number" value="1" min="0" max="1000" step="0.01" required><small>Use the ad network’s publisher eCPM. $1 is an example, not a market forecast.</small></label><label>Creator share (%)<input name="creatorShare" type="number" value="<%= monetization.creatorSharePercent %>" min="0" max="100" step="1" required><small>The proposed share is 50% of finalized valid ad revenue.</small></label><button class="button" type="submit">Calculate estimate</button></form><section class="card estimate" aria-live="polite"><p class="eyebrow">ILLUSTRATIVE MONTHLY ESTIMATE</p><h2>Creator’s share</h2><output id="creator-earning">$3.50</output><div class="estimate-row"><span>Filled ad impressions</span><strong id="impressions">7,000</strong></div><div class="estimate-row"><span>Total ad revenue</span><strong id="total-earning">$7.00</strong></div><div class="estimate-row"><span>Platform share, before costs</span><strong id="platform-earning">$3.50</strong></div><p class="formula">Page views × slots × fill rate ÷ 1,000 × publisher eCPM</p><p class="muted">Excludes hosting costs, taxes, payout fees and ad-network adjustments. Payouts require settled, creator-attributed revenue and a minimum payout amount.</p><p class="alert" id="calculator-error" hidden></p></section></div></section><%- include('footer') %>
